<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>StudyForge — Dashboard</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,600;8..60,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');

  :root{
    --paper: #FAF6EE;
    --ink: #1F3A3D;
    --ink-soft: #52696B;
    --line: #DDD4C0;
    --amber: #C8862B;
    --amber-soft: #F3E3C8;
    --sage: #7C9885;
    --sage-soft: #E4EBE3;
    --card: #FFFFFF;
    --radius: 3px;
  }

  *{ box-sizing: border-box; }

  body{
    margin:0;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  h1, h2, .brand{
    font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif;
  }

  a{ color: inherit; }

  .shell{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  /* ---------- Sidebar ---------- */
  .sidebar{
    border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 28px 22px;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap: 36px;
  }

  .brand{
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .brand span{ color: var(--amber); }

  .nav-group-label{
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .nav-list{
    list-style:none;
    margin:0 0 24px 0;
    padding:0;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:2px;
  }

  .nav-list a{
    display:block;
    text-decoration:none;
    font-size: 14px;
    padding: 7px 10px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .nav-list a.active{
    background: var(--sage-soft);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .nav-list a:hover:not(.active){
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
  }

  .sidebar-footer{
    margin-top:auto;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    padding-top: 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  /* ---------- Main ---------- */
  main{
    padding: 40px 48px 60px;
  }

  .page-head{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:flex-end;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .page-head h1{
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
  }

  .page-head p{
    margin:0;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .today{
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    text-align:right;
  }

  .grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr 1.1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items:start;
  }

  .card{
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 22px;
  }

  .card h2{
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 4px;
  }

  .card .sub{
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }

  /* Deadlines */
  .deadline-row{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:flex-start;
    padding: 12px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .deadline-row:first-of-type{ border-top:none; padding-top:0; }

  .deadline-title{
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 2px;
  }
  .deadline-course{
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin:0;
  }

  .pill{
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .pill.urgent{ background: #F5DCD3; color: #9C4A2E; }
  .pill.normal{ background: var(--sage-soft); color: #4C6B54; }

  /* Learning */
  .learn-row{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    padding: 11px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .learn-row:first-of-type{ border-top:none; padding-top:0; }

  .learn-title{ font-size: 14px; }

  .status-tag{
    font-size: 11.5px;
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--amber-soft);
    color: #8A5A16;
  }
  .status-tag.practicing{
    background: var(--sage-soft);
    color: #4C6B54;
  }

  /* Weekly summary */
  .summary-card{
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    border: none;
  }
  .summary-card h2{ color: var(--paper); }
  .summary-card .sub{ color: #A9BFC0; }
  .summary-card p.body{
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  .summary-card ul{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    list-style:none;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:8px;
  }
  .summary-card li{
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #D7E2DC;
    padding-left: 14px;
    position:relative;
  }
  .summary-card li::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    left:0; top:7px;
    width:5px; height:5px;
    background: var(--amber);
    border-radius:50%;
  }

  .empty{
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px){
    .shell{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .sidebar{ display:none; }
    .grid{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    main{ padding: 28px 22px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="shell">

  <aside class="sidebar">
    <div class="brand">Study<span>Forge</span></div>

    <div>
      <p class="nav-group-label">Overview</p>
      <ul class="nav-list">
        <li><a href="#" class="active">Dashboard</a></li>
      </ul>

      <p class="nav-group-label">Course Mode</p>
      <ul class="nav-list">
        <li><a href="#">Courses</a></li>
        <li><a href="#">AI Tutor</a></li>
      </ul>

      <p class="nav-group-label">Growth Mode</p>
      <ul class="nav-list">
        <li><a href="#">Learning Board</a></li>
        <li><a href="#">Roadmap</a></li>
        <li><a href="#">Skills</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="sidebar-footer">Alyssa Merjilla<br>alyssa@studyforge.dev</div>
  </aside>

  <main>
    <div class="page-head">
      <div>
        <h1>Dashboard</h1>
        <p>Everything due, everything you're building — one place.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="today">Friday, September 4</div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">

      <!-- Deadlines -->
      <section class="card">
        <h2>Upcoming Deadlines</h2>
        <p class="sub">Across all courses</p>

        <div class="deadline-row">
          <div>
            <p class="deadline-title">Database Design Proposal</p>
            <p class="deadline-course">CS 340 — Databases</p>
          </div>
          <span class="pill urgent">Today</span>
        </div>

        <div class="deadline-row">
          <div>
            <p class="deadline-title">Problem Set 6</p>
            <p class="deadline-course">MATH 221 — Linear Algebra</p>
          </div>
          <span class="pill urgent">2d</span>
        </div>

        <div class="deadline-row">
          <div>
            <p class="deadline-title">Group Presentation Slides</p>
            <p class="deadline-course">BUS 210 — Marketing</p>
          </div>
          <span class="pill normal">5d</span>
        </div>

        <div class="deadline-row">
          <div>
            <p class="deadline-title">Reading Response #4</p>
            <p class="deadline-course">ENGL 150 — Rhetoric</p>
          </div>
          <span class="pill normal">6d</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Active learning -->
      <section class="card">
        <h2>Active Learning</h2>
        <p class="sub">Growth Mode</p>

        <div class="learn-row">
          <span class="learn-title">TypeScript generics</span>
          <span class="status-tag">Learning</span>
        </div>
        <div class="learn-row">
          <span class="learn-title">SQL query optimization</span>
          <span class="status-tag practicing">Practicing</span>
        </div>
        <div class="learn-row">
          <span class="learn-title">System design basics</span>
          <span class="status-tag">Learning</span>
        </div>
        <div class="learn-row">
          <span class="learn-title">Behavioral interview prep</span>
          <span class="status-tag practicing">Practicing</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Weekly summary -->
      <section class="card summary-card">
        <h2>This Week</h2>
        <p class="sub">Generated Sunday night</p>
        <p class="body">You cleared three assignments and moved SQL optimization into practice — good pace heading into midterms. Linear Algebra is the one to watch this week.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Finished the Databases ER-diagram assignment</li>
          <li>Mastered "joins vs. subqueries"</li>
          <li>2 deadlines land within 2 days — plan for those first</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>

</div>

</body>
</html>
